        <briefdescription>
<para>Number of layers, or channel groups, in the Audio Element. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>There may be 6 layers at most, and for <ref refid="structAVIAMFAudioElement_1a3199850332a351361748c92b6cb8f8ad" kindref="member">audio_element_type</ref> AV_IAMF_AUDIO_ELEMENT_TYPE_SCENE, there may be exactly 1.</para>
<para>Set by <ref refid="group__lavu__iamf__audio_1ga0ca03f0e3c20b24670a88f7cb1ef656d" kindref="member">av_iamf_audio_element_add_layer()</ref>, must not be modified by any other code. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
